                      (        forth.asm):04031         * particular purpose here: a 16x16 bit unsigned multiplication that yields
                      (        forth.asm):04032         * a 32 bit result. A simpler description of algorithm M can be found in
                      (        forth.asm):04033         * Henry S. Warren Junior's "Hacker's Delight", second edition, section 8-1,
                      (        forth.asm):04034         * pp 171. A C prototype implementation for a little endian host is provided
                      (        forth.asm):04035         * in SW/util/umstar.c.
                      (        forth.asm):04036         * In essence we reduce the problem to a 2 digit by 2 digit (expressed in
